                      "value": "Your heightened senses allow you to instinctively detect unseen opponents. You don't need to succeed at a flat check to target concealed creatures. You're not off-guard to creatures that are hidden from you (unless you're off-guard to them for reasons other than the hidden condition), and you need only a successful DC 5 flat check to target a hidden creature.\n\nWhile you're adjacent to an undetected creature of your level or lower, it is instead only hidden from you."
